      "telephone": "415-473-6456",
      "mission": "Our mission is to conduct elections in a responsive, transparent, and professional manner that will inspire trust and confidence in our work while promoting engagement with all Marin County residents in the election process. Natalie Adona",
      "description": "The Elections Department provides election services year-round to Marin County’s approximately 174,000 registered voters. Each year, the department plans for and manages regularly scheduled elections and special elections called by the cities, towns, schools, and special districts in Marin County. DEPARTMENT BUDGET - ELECTIONS"
