      "telephone": "415-473-6154",
      "mission": "The mission of the Department of Finance is to safeguard public funds and protect the county’s financial integrity by advocating best practices, ensuring compliance with mandates and meeting fiduciary obligations. Mina Martinovich",
      "description": "The Department of Finance is responsible for the statutory functions and duties of the office of the auditor, controller, treasurer, tax collector, and public administrator. Our office is comprised of ten work units, each with their own unique and specialized set of County program areas. DEPARTMENT BUDGET - FINANCE"
