      "telephone": "415-473-6147",
      "mission": "Our mission is to provide superior customer services to members and beneficiaries of the Marin County Employees’ Retirement Association through efficient benefits administration and a commitment to integrity and prudent financial management. Jeff Wickman",
      "description": "The Marin County Employees’ Retirement Association (MCERA) is a multiple-employer governmental pension plan established by the County of Marin on July 1, 1950 under the County Employees Retirement Law of 1937. MCERA staff, under the direction from the Retirement Administrator, assist the Retirement Board in the administration of the retirement system."
