        "@type": "PostalAddress",
        "streetAddress": "1600 Los Gamos Drive, Suite 200",
        "addressLocality": "San Rafael",
        "addressRegion": "CA",
        "postalCode": "94903",
        "addressCountry": "US"
      },
      "telephone": "415-473-7250",
      "mission": "The Marin County Sheriff’s Office is committed to partnering with our communities to provide leadership and excellence in public safety. 1600 Los Gamos Drive, Suite 200 San Rafael, CA 94903 Tel: 415-473-7250 MarinCounty.gov/Sheriff",
      "description": "The Sheriff is a constitutionally elected official whose primary responsibilities are to enforce local, state and Federal laws, operate the county jail and provide security to the Superior Court. The department also operates law enforcement dispatch services, assumes the duties of the county coroner and provides patrol services in unincorporated areas of the County. DEPARTMENT BUDGET - MARIN COUNTY SHERIFF CORONER’S OFFICE"
